@module fade ; The corner gradients and the exit fade
@about The four 5x5 corners of the attributes are gradients from CornerColours $ADF4 (src/res/tables/corner-colours.txt): the top-left and bottom-right corners a colour a row, the top-right and bottom-left ones a colour a column. At the launch ExitFade $6E72 shifts every pixel row out of its bytes in 8 passes, alternately in and out, until the screen is black.

$6CBF c ColourCorners ; Colour the four 5x5 corners with CornerColours
> Witness: L1 4 (c x4).

$6CD8 c ColourCornerRows ; At HL, 5 rows of 5 cells: row n all CornerColours[n]
