@module buffers ; The work space between the pieces: never loaded, cleared by the loader, filled by Start
@about $70A8-$A5FF lies between the code (15 sectors from $61A8) and the graphics ($A600): the loader's clear leaves zeros, Start builds the rhombus phases there and reads the catalogue into Catalogue $9D00.

$70A8 s Unused1 ; Not written: SoundOff reads its zeros at $7530

$7600 s RombColumns ; RombColumnOrder's copy (40)

$765C s RombOffsets ; RombPhaseOffsets's copy (9)

$768E s RombThreshold ; Phase 8's threshold: $40 for set A, $80 for set B

$7698 s PhaseMask ; 40 bytes: 1 for each column the phase keeps

$76C0 s PhaseOffset ; The phase's start column

$76C1 s Unused2 ; Not used

$7700 s RombWork ; The rhombus being turned (200)

$77C8 s Unused3 ; Not used

$7800 s PhasesA ; Set A (turning about the vertical axis): phases 0-8, 256 bytes each

$8100 s MirrorsA ; Set A: phases 9-16, the mirror images of 0-7

$8900 s Unused4 ; Not used

$8A00 s PhasesB ; Set B (turning about the horizontal axis): phases 0-8

$9300 s MirrorsB ; Set B: phases 9-16

$9B00 s Unused5 ; Not used

$9C00 s RotateBuffer ; RotateSprite's work (200)

$9CC8 s Unused6 ; Not used

$9D00 s Catalogue ; The disk's catalogue: track 0 sectors 0-7, 128 entries of 16 bytes

$A500 s FontBase ; Not used: Chars points here (Font - 256)

